WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:02.934
-We love you and your family,
and they've said some things

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:05.334
over the years that have
become iconic quotes.

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:07.067
-Okay.
-And so we wanted to put

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:10.267
your knowledge to the test in
a new game called "Who Said It?"

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:11.801
-Perfect.

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:13.868
♪ -Who said it? ♪

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:16.200
♪ Tell me who said it ♪

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.234
-Why am I nervous?

00:00:19.234 --> 00:00:22.634
-How it works is I'm going to
read you real quotes that you,

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:24.701
your sisters, or your mom, Kris,
have said,

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:26.501
and you have to tell me
who said it.

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:27.667
-Okay.
-Here we go.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:29.400
-I feel like I'm not going to be
good at this.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.167
-First up, here we go.

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:34.067
Who said, "Would you stop taking
pictures of yourself?

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.467
Your sister's going to jail."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:39.100
-That is actually one of
my favorite moments,

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.767
so I know exactly who this is.

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:43.033
It was my mom.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:45.901
♪♪

00:00:45.901 --> 00:00:47.601
-Let's see who said it.
Here we go.

00:00:47.601 --> 00:00:49.734
-Kim, would you stop taking
pictures of yourself?

00:00:49.734 --> 00:00:51.100
Your sister's going to jail.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.767
[ Laughter ]
[ Ding! ]

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:55.033
♪♪

00:00:55.033 --> 00:01:00.267
-Who said, "Honey, would you put
a bumper sticker on a Bentley?"

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:03.467
-Kim. That was her thing
she would always say.

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:04.868
-Let's see who said it.

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:08.601
-Honey, would you put a bumper
sticker on a Bentley?

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:12.067
-Yeah, that's exactly right.
Good, you got two.

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:13.667
[ Applause ]

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:15.701
This one might be
my favorite one.

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:18.868
Who said, "You're cute jeans."

00:01:18.868 --> 00:01:21.767
-Me.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.767 --> 00:01:23.701
-I think you're right.
Let's see who said it.

00:01:23.701 --> 00:01:24.901
-Those are cute jeans.

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:26.200
-You're cute jeans.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:30.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:30.734 --> 00:01:32.634
-I don't even know,
like, what that was.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:34.167
-Dude, that was just
saying to your mom

00:01:34.167 --> 00:01:35.267
that you love her, yeah.
-Exactly.

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:37.133
-She's cute.
Those are cute jeans.

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:38.400
You're cute jeans.
-Exactly.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.400
-I love that.
That's my favorite quote.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:45.567
Who said, "But just knowing
you're a badass bitch

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:50.701
is just all what life is about."

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:52.901
-I really don't know this one.
Oh, no.

00:01:52.901 --> 00:01:54.534
-"Just knowing
you're a badass bitch

00:01:54.534 --> 00:01:56.133
is just all what life is about."

00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:58.033
-Khloe. I'll guess Khloe.

00:01:58.033 --> 00:01:59.467
-Let's see who said it.

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:01.334
-But just knowing
you're a badass bitch

00:02:01.334 --> 00:02:02.801
is just all what life is about."

00:02:02.801 --> 00:02:04.434
-That's what I'm talking about.
It was Khloe.

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:07.100
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Of course it was.

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.000
-[ Laughs ]
-Oh, no.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.501
-This might be
my other favorite.

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:14.133
"You're cute jeans" is my other,
but this one is a great quote.

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:17.234
"A, B, C, D, E, F, G,
I have to go."

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:18.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:21.000
-It's Kourtney and it's so good.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.434
-Watch this.

00:02:22.434 --> 00:02:25.767
-A, B, C, D, E, F, G,
I have to go.

00:02:25.767 --> 00:02:27.934
-What the heck does
A, B, C, D, E, F, G mean?

00:02:27.934 --> 00:02:30.667
[ Ding! ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:31.934
-That's really good.

00:02:31.934 --> 00:02:32.868
-What does that have to do --

00:02:32.868 --> 00:02:34.334
-Scott's reaction is everything.

00:02:34.334 --> 00:02:36.033
-Scott was like,
"What's A, B, C, D, E, F, G?"

00:02:36.033 --> 00:02:38.534
-By the way, you have to find
the extended clips of all these

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:41.534
because they end up getting into
funny moments afterwards.

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:44.567
It's really good.
-But did she forget H?

00:02:44.567 --> 00:02:45.801
Is that the way it works?

00:02:45.801 --> 00:02:48.601
Like, "A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H,
I have to go."

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:51.701
-Oh! Yeah, I feel like she did
say it wrong, by the way,

00:02:51.701 --> 00:02:53.634
'cause I think it was
a meme or a quote.

00:02:53.634 --> 00:02:55.234
-I don't know what it is
but I love it.

00:02:55.234 --> 00:02:57.167
-And she tried to use it
and kind of botched it,

00:02:57.167 --> 00:02:58.200
but it became a whole thing.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.534
It's all over TikTok, I guess.

00:02:59.534 --> 00:03:02.033
-It's all over TikTok, yeah.
I love that one, though.

00:03:02.033 --> 00:03:03.634
That and "you're cute --" Oh.

00:03:03.634 --> 00:03:06.400
Who said, "Rise and shine"?

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:08.434
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, this one's --

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:09.734
Kylie, obviously.
-Yeah, here we go.

00:03:09.734 --> 00:03:11.734
-This one's good.
-Let's take a look.

00:03:11.734 --> 00:03:13.234
♪ -Rise and shine ♪

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:14.801
[ Laughter ]
[ Ding! ]

00:03:14.801 --> 00:03:17.467
-That's what I'm talking about.
Kendall Jenner!

00:03:17.467 --> 00:03:20.634
Her new tequila 818
is available now.

